The selected test episodes include one official expert demonstration and three
pi0 policy rollouts. Task-matched goal references come from separate successful
expert episodes. Only external-camera frames enter the model; wrist videos are
viewing aids. Videos, reference images, and recorded predictions are unchanged.
Source episode information accompanies the predictions.json file for each case.

The expert demonstration and goal references are selected from the LIBERO
datasets; the three policy rollouts were recorded in the LIBERO simulator. These
are selected qualitative examples, not a representative benchmark.
